Android player: GHOST backend, NativeActivity entry point and build glue.

UPBGE-owned files (source/gameengine, source/blenderplayer).

- GamePlayer/android: GPG_SystemAndroid / GPG_WindowAndroid (GHOST over
  android_native_app_glue: looper events, touch as mouse, keys, lifecycle v1:
  losing the window ends the game) and android_main() (asset extraction,
  environment, stdout/stderr to logcat, argv).
- GPG_ghost.cpp: main() is GPG_main() on Android and creates that system.
- CMake: Android sources in ge_player; blenderplayer is the NativeActivity
  library libupbgeplayer.so with the glue compiled in.

Base: UPBGE master 42b4210c153769f44c262fdeab6f0f805a551911
Apply: scripts/apply_patches.sh (patch -p1 in the UPBGE checkout)

